\par\par \b \uc2 JEMAI - Annual Report by Foreign Government/Political Subdivision - Form 18-K\b0\par\par\uc2 JEMAI published this content on 07 Aug 2023 and is solely responsible for the information contained herein. Distributed by PUBT, unedited and unaltered, on 07 Aug 2023 10:24:38 UTC. \par \uc2 21,415 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 August 2023\par \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) Filings\par \uc2 SAEXC\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2023. As included in the Information \par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/837056/0001193125-23-204368-index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Access the original document here}}}\par \par \uc2 Annual Report by Foreign Government/Political Subdivision - Form 18-K\par \par \uc2 Japan\par \par \uc2 This description of Japan is dated August 7, 2023, and appears as Exhibit 1 to Japan's Annual Report on Form 18-K to the \uc2 U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  for the fiscal year ended March 31, 2023.\par \par \uc2 THE DELIVERY OF THIS DOCUMENT AT ANY TIME DOES NOT IMPLY THAT THE INFORMATION IS CORRECT AS OF ANY TIME SUBSEQUENT TO ITS DATE. THIS DOCUMENT (OTHERWISE THAN AS PART OF A PROSPECTUS CONTAINED IN A REGISTRATION STATEMENT FILED UNDER THE U.S. SECURITIES ACT OF 1933) DOES NOT CONSTITUTE AN OFFER TO SELL OR THE SOLICITATION OF AN OFFER TO BUY ANY SECURITIES OF OR GUARANTEED BY JAPAN.\par \par \uc2 TABLE OF CONTENTS\par \par \uc2 \f2 GENERAL                                                     4    \par Area and Population                                         4    \par Government                                                  4    \par Political Parties                                           4    \par Leadership                                                  5    \par International Organizations                                 5    \par International Trade Agreements                              6    \par THE ECONOMY                                        