t22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  when USD/JPY reached 151.94 expectations for the 2022-23 financial year were around 114, and have been lifted toward 131 for the current financial year. While that's closer to the current reality of 145 than it was last year, it leaves Japanese companies poorly hedged and risking losses from unexpected \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  movement For more click on\par \par \uc2 (Jeremy Boulton is a Reuters market analyst. The views expressed are his own)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2023-7-3T08:32:04.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020230630ej6u00sbh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
