\par\par \b \uc2 LIVE MARKETS-China lends support to European futures\b0\par\par\uc2 536 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Juni 2023\par 08:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Welcome to the home for real-time coverage of markets brought to you by Reuters reporters. You can share your thoughts with us at\par \par \uc2 CHINA LENDS SUPPORT TO EUROPEAN FUTURES (0640 GMT)\par \par \uc2 European futures are getting a lift from assurances that Beijing would support flagging growth in the world's second-largest economy, which helped investors shift their focus away from risks around interest rates and Russia.\par \par \uc2 Premier Li Qiang said economic growth in the second quarter would be higher than the first and that Beijing would roll out more effective policies to expand domestic demand and open markets.\par \par \uc2 The Chinese yuan also perked up significantly as \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  guidance sent a clear warning to traders that authorities were becoming less tolerant of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's recent weakness.\par \par \uc2 In the UK, water industry regulator \uc2 Ofwat\uc2  gave its go ahead to schemes totalling 2.2 billion pounds ($2.80 billion) for starting work on infrastructure in the next two financial years and tackle problems such as storm overflows.\par \par \uc2 EUROSTOXX futures are up 0.5%, while futures on the DAX and FTSE 100 are also both up 0.5%.\par \par \uc2 (Joice Alves)\par \par \uc2 \f2 ******\par               \par               \par               \par               \par CHINA GETS WEARY OF A WEAKENING YUAN (0635 GMT)\par               \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The U.S. dollar's protracted smile is making China and Japan uncomfortable. China, unencumbered as it is by global pacts and commitments on market rates, has reacted swiftly this week. State banks have sold dollars to slow the yuan's decline, and the mid-point for daily trade has also been adjusted.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The next cab off the rank is \f28 \uc2 \f2 Japan's finance ministry\f28 \uc2 \f2 , and top yen diplomat Masato Kanda is "not ruling out any" options to fix a rapid and one-sided yen decline.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Both countries have not done much since mid-May as the dollar cruised higher, gaining 8%-10% against their \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and for any number of reasons - the yields, the flailing Chinese economy and the health of banks.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 But it's time to get twitchy when the yuan is closing in on the 7.3-per-dollar levels last seen in November and, before that, in 2008. Likewise, when it's around the 145-150 levels, the yen tips the cost-benefit balance for Japan too. Japan's yen has weakened against the dollar so far this year significantly more than its regional counterparts.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The yuan has slid more than 4% against the dollar so far this year. One factor that might be worrying Chinese authorities, analysts say, is that the yuan's value against its major trading partners has fallen 2.16% this year, according to Reuters calculations based on official data.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Meanwhile, as we wait to see when \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan intervenes\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , it helps to remember \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  always goes for big. Think September and October 2022, when it spent upwards of $60 billion as the yen fell to 32-year lows. Those with short yen positions hoping to time a perfect trade need only look at the yen chart, and its 14 yen rally over 3 weeks for a tip.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Key developments that could influence markets on Tuesday: Britain house prices, ECB's Sintra conference kicks off.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (Vidya Ranganathan)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ***** \f28 \par \par \uc2 Released: 2023-6-27T07:45:16.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020230627ej6r00ooz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
