\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Dollar edges off 15-month high vs rouble as Russia eyed\b0\par\par\uc2 538 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Juni 2023\par 21:40\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Updates prices, adds Prigozhin comments)\par \par \uc2 By Chuck Mikolajczak\par \par \uc2 NEW YORK, June 26 (Reuters) - The dollar rose against the rouble on Monday, although it had pulled back from the 15-month high hit earlier in the session, while the Japanese yen gained modestly against the greenback following comments from the country's top \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  diplomat.\par \par \uc2 After last being seen on Saturday night, the leader of the Wagner mercenary group, \uc2 Yevgeny Prigozhin\uc2 , whose weekend mutiny appeared to pose a major threat to Russian President \uc2 Vladimir Putin\uc2 's 23-year-old rule, said he had never intended to overthrow the government.\par \par \uc2 Prigozhin made no reference to his location or the deal that defused the mutiny.\par \par \uc2 "We had that rapid escalation and just as fast de-escalation and it goes to show you this was a serious a threat for Putin to agree to terms to make a deal with Prigozhin," said \uc2 Edward Moya\uc2 , senior market analyst at \uc2 OANDA\uc2  in New York.\par \par \uc2 "It really looks like the focus will probably shift back until we have a clearer understanding of that to the global growth slowdown we are seeing."\par \par \uc2 The Russian rouble weakened 0.90% versus the greenback at 84.40 per dollar after hitting its weakest level since March 2022.\par \par \uc2 The dollar was softer against the yen, after Vice Finance Minister for International Affairs Masato Kanda said Japan was not ruling out any options in possible responses to excessive \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves.\par \par \uc2 The Japanese yen strengthened 0.16% versus the greenback at 143.48 per dollar. The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the yen when it traded around 145 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 "Whenever you have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  and you have seen it work a little bit and then the price comes back to where you \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the past it\u8217\'20\'19s like oh, start jawboning again," said Moya.\par \par \uc2 The Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has come under pressure as the \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  has maintained its soft monetary policy, while central banks around the globe have embarked on a rapid path of hiking interest rates to combat stubbornly high inflation.\par \par \uc2 The dollar index fell 0.049% at 102.680, with safe-haven support helping to keep it near the unchanged mark as concerns about a slowing global economy linger in the midst of aggressive tightening actions by multiple central banks around the globe.\par \par \uc2 The euro up 0.21% to $1.0912 ahead of remarks by \uc2 European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President \uc2 Christine Lagarde\uc2  at the ECB Forum on Central Banking in Sintra.\par \par \uc2 Earlier data in the region showed German business morale worsened for the second consecutive month in June, indicating that Europe's largest economy faces an uphill battle to shake off recession.\par \par \uc2 Sterling was last trading at $1.2719, up 0.06% on the day.\par \par \uc2 In Asia, the dollar rose 0.40% against the offshore Chinese yuan to $7.2445 after hitting a 7-month high as investors braced for potentially more support measures as China returned from a holiday on Monday. Further stimulus measures were expected as from Beijing tries to bolster China's flagging economic recovery.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Chuck Mikolajczak; Editing by Mark Heinrich and Lisa Shumaker) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2023-6-26T20:40:34.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020230626ej6q02wed\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
