\par\par \b \uc2 REFILE- \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  confirms  \highlight22\uc2 FX interventions \highlight\uc2  twice in Oct to support yen\b0\par\par\uc2 259 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Februar 2023\par 01:06\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Corrects to add missing letter in headline)\par \par \uc2 TOKYO, Feb 7 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed on Tuesday that it did \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market twice in October to support its yen \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MOF) data showed on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 The quarterly data showed a steep drop in the yen to a 32-year low of 151.94 to the dollar on Oct. 21 triggered the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  that day, followed by another on Oct. 24.\par \par \uc2 The stealth \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , or making a foray in the market without announcing it, came after Tokyo \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy the yen for dollars for the first time in 24 years on Sept. 22.\par \par \uc2 Japan spent a record 6.35 trillion yen ($47.9 billion) on two unannounced \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in October, having spent 2.84 trillion yen on Sept. 22 to stem the yen's sharp fall, which boosted living costs for resource-deficiant Japan.\par \par \uc2 The dollar has pulled back to move in a range around 130 yen since then, while stoking some concerns about renewed yen rises, which could hamper Japanese exports of cars and electronics.\par \par \uc2 It was rare for \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  to conduct yen-buying, dollar-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  given the country's past battle with a strong yen making Japanese goods less competitive overseas.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  publishes monthly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  records at the end of each month, and it issues daily results for the prior quarter. ($1 = 132.5500 yen) (Reporting by Tetsushi Kajimoto; Editing by Stephen Coates) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2023-2-7T01:06:34.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020230207ej270008e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
